# Files git should never track or upload. Anything listed here stays on this Mac only.

# ---------- Secrets ----------
# Keys, tokens and passwords never go in the code. The server reads its GitHub token
# from the GITHUB_TOKEN environment variable at run time; locally ./run.sh gets it from
# the gh tool, so it never needs to be written in a file at all. If you ever do keep
# one in a file, name it so it matches a rule below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.secret
*.secrets
secrets/
secrets.*
credentials*
*.token
*token*.txt
# Private keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
# Fly.io's local login and config overrides
.fly/
fly.local.toml

# ---------- Personal ----------
# My personal to-do notes
abel.md
# Design tool settings (Impeccable), not part of the site
.impeccable/
# Local Claude Code tooling, not part of the site
.claude/

# ---------- Build output ----------
# Compiled Java classes from ./run.sh
build/
build-test/
build-pages/
.pages-worktree/

# ---------- Clutter ----------
# Mac's hidden folder-settings files
.DS_Store
# Installed packages, if you ever add them
node_modules/
# Leftovers from the old Python server
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.log
